| !HelloTeapot: the Raspberry Pi hello_teapot example (OpenGL ES 1.1 through
| DispmanX), rebuilt from source against riscos-mesa. On the Pi it showed a
| video on the teapot; there is no video decoder here, so it wears a still
| picture. It runs in a desktop window and multitasks; close the window
| (or press any key) to quit.
Set HelloTeapot$Dir <Obey$Dir>
| riscos-mesa's DispmanX library shows the program's "display" in a desktop
| window, 640 pixels wide. To change that, set HelloTeapot$Display below to a
| size (e.g. 800x450) or to full for the whole screen, as on the Pi (then it
| doesn't multitask, and any key quits).
Unset HelloTeapot$Display
| Set HelloTeapot$Display full
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error !HelloTeapot needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0.00 RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0.00 Error !HelloTeapot needs ARMEABISupport
Run <HelloTeapot$Dir>.!RunImage
